# Archival preservation notice

The games and software in this repository are shareware/embeddable titles that were
distributed freely with the Champak magazine (Delhi Press) as Jogo Disk cover CDs,
produced by Digerati, from the mid-2000s to the early 2010s.

This repository is an **archival and educational** project. All material is preserved
in its original form for historical and research purposes. The rights to the individual
games, the Jogo Disk brand, the Champak magazine and the Digerati brand remain with
their respective owners. No claim of ownership is made over any third-party content.

If you are a rights holder and would like material removed or credited differently,
please open an issue on this repository and it will be addressed.
